WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.737
-Last night, even after
a violent insurrection

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.906
at the U.S. Capitol attempted to
overthrow American democracy,

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.175
a majority of Republicans
in the House

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.310
and a handful of GOP senators

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.913
tried to throw out the results
of the presidential election,

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.449
and now, the right-wing media
is already trying

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:19.085
to blame the left
for the sedition they sowed.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.587
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:25.658 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.894
Yesterday, there was
a violent insurrection

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.063
and attempted sedition
in the United States,

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.198
and as we noted
on this show last night,

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.401
what we all witnessed was,
unfortunately,

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.535
a familiar part
of American history.

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:40.773
It's not all of what America is,
and, in fact, it's been rejected

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.276
by a majority of Americans
in election after election,

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.178
including in Georgia
on Tuesday,

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:49.048
but it is very much a part of
what America is,

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.650
and as we said
last night, as well,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.619
there have been violent
white supremacist coups

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:55.021
in this country before --
like the mob riot

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:57.223
in Wilmington,
North Carolina, in 1898

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.458
that overthrew a
legitimately elected

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.693
biracial government.

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:03.530
No one ever learns that stuff
in history class

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.164
because our textbooks
whitewash it.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:07.333
In fact, I'm pretty sure
my history textbook

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.934
jumped from the end
of the Civil War

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.669
to the Great Depression,
and the chapter in between

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:12.939
was just called
"Yada Yada Yada."

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:15.341
And if you want to step outside
the bubble of American media

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.910
for just a moment and get
a truly harrowing look

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.378
at the state of our democracy

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:21.881
from the vantage point
of the rest of the world,

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.350
take a few minutes
to watch this report

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.051
from a British
television network

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:27.420
on the violence at the Capitol.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.922 line:0%
-The pro-Trump crowd
fought with the police.

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:31.090 line:0%
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.558 line:0%
-Hey!

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:34.927 line:0%
-Trying to break
through their lines...

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:36.229 line:0%
[ Shouting continues ]

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.565 line:0%
...intoxicated by
the unlikely prospect

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:41.000 line:0%
of reversing America's
election outcome.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.702 line:0%
This is exactly
what was feared,

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:45.738 line:0%
but in no way
is this a surprise.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:49.008 line:0%
It has been fueled by
the president's rhetoric.

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:52.411
We follow the aggrieved
and infuriated Trump supporters

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:54.747
as they stormed the building...

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.349
-I swear that's CNN,

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:58.450
and they just said these guys...

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.820
-...through broken windows

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.622
and doors
they had forced open,

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:03.990
and for a few heady moments,

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.459
they felt they had won
a precious victory.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:09.362
America's long journey
as a stable democracy

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.664
appears to be
in genuine doubt.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.399
-Wow, that is sobering.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:16.702
Nothing opens your eyes
like hearing a British person

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.704
