your bad behavior.

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:21.407
Like, I think I'm a pretty good
dad and husband,

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.177
but I wouldn't if I heard
the BBC say,

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.212
