morning, and he's still in bed,

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.915
his wife downstairs
making breakfast for his sons.

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:32.318
He knows he could
provide assistance,

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.654
yet he idly scrolls
through his Twitter feed.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:35.821
Looking for what?

00:02:35.821 --> 00:02:38.625
Even he doesn't know."

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.192
[ Normal voice ] So, can
