00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:47.733
I mean, there have been
violent insurrections

00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:50.136
in this country before
and without consequences,

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.770
and it's gonna happen again.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.540
That's why the people
